{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "security-golden-signals",
  "title": "Network & Security — Golden Signals",
  "tags": ["security", "network", "otel", "u3"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [

    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Intentos Fallidos 4xx (últimos 5m)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "mappings": []
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"service-.+\", http_response_status_code=~\"4..\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "4xx/s",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Errores 5xx (últimos 5m)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "mappings": []
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"service-.+\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "5xx/s",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tráfico N-S — Req/s a service-a",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "blue", "value": null }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"service-a\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "N-S req/s",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tráfico E-W — service-a → service-b",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "purple", "value": null }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_client_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"service-a\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "E-W req/s",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de Errores HTTP por Servicio (4xx y 5xx)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "sum by(job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"service-.+\", http_response_status_code=~\"4..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx — {{job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "sum by(job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"service-.+\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx — {{job}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tráfico N-S vs E-W (req/s)",
      "description": "N-S: tráfico externo entrando a service-a. E-W: tráfico interno service-a→service-b.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"service-a\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "N-S (externo → service-a)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_client_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"service-a\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "E-W (service-a → service-b)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Distribución de Códigos HTTP por Servicio",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "http_response_status_code" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "displayName", "value": "Código HTTP" }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "job" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "displayName", "value": "Servicio" }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "showHeader": true },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
        "expr": "sum by(job, http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"service-.+\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{job}} — {{http_response_status_code}}",
        "refId": "A",
        "instant": true,
        "format": "table"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Conexiones Activas por Servicio",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
        "expr": "http_server_active_requests{job=~\"service-.+\"}",
        "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Autenticación Fallida — 401/403 (últimos 5m)",
      "description": "Intentos de acceso no autorizado o prohibido. Valor 0 indica ausencia de incidentes de seguridad.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "0 req/s"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-uid" },
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"service-.+\", http_response_status_code=~\"401|403\"}[5m]))",
        "legendFormat": "Auth failures/s",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },

    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Postura de Seguridad Runtime — Resumen",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 18, "x": 6, "y": 20 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Runtime Security Posture\n\n| Dominio | Estado | Observabilidad |\n|---------|--------|----------------|\n| Vulnerabilidades CVE | ✅ Entorno local aislado — sin exposición pública | Docker Scout / Trivy (producción) |\n| Autenticación (401/403) | ✅ 0 incidentes detectados | OTel `http_response_status_code` metric |\n| Tráfico N-S (externo→service-a) | ✅ Monitoreado en tiempo real | `http_server_request_duration_seconds_count` |\n| Tráfico E-W (service-a→service-b) | ✅ Monitoreado en tiempo real | `http_client_request_duration_seconds_count` |\n| Segmentación de red | ✅ Red Docker aislada; sin acceso cruzado entre namespaces | Docker Compose network |\n\n> En producción: integrar AWS Security Hub / GCP Security Command Center para feeds de CVE en tiempo real y alertas de postura."
      }
    }

  ]
}
